<view class="page-shell">
  <view class="hero">
    <image
      class="hero__image"
      src="/assets/brand/rongguang-hero-shiba.png"
      mode="aspectFill"
      aria-label="晨光中的柴犬"
    />
    <view class="hero__veil"></view>
    <view class="hero__content">
      <view class="wordmark">
        <text class="wordmark__title">茸光</text>
        <text class="wordmark__subtitle">— 宠物洗护 —</text>
      </view>
      <button class="hero__identity" bindtap="chooseCustomer">
        {{customer ? '演示顾客 · ' + customer.displayName : '选择演示顾客'}} ›
      </button>
      <view class="opening">
        <text>{{businessHours}}</text>
        <text class="opening__date">{{demoTime}}</text>
        <text class="opening__demo-label">上海演示时间</text>
      </view>
      <button class="hero__cta" bindtap="primaryAction">
        {{customer ? '查看我的预约记录' : '选择顾客开始体验'}}
        <text>›</text>
      </button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{authState === 'active' || authState === 'unavailable'}}" class="readiness-card">
    <view class="readiness-card__topline">
      <view class="readiness-card__avatar">{{customer.avatarInitial}}</view>
      <view class="readiness-card__identity">
        <text>{{customer.displayName}}</text>
        <text class="readiness-card__story">{{customer.story}}</text>
      </view>
      <text class="readiness-card__status">会话有效</text>
    </view>
    <text class="readiness-card__body">
      当前体验故事为“{{customer.story}}”。四个主页面都会跟随 {{customer.displayName}} 的演示身份。
    </text>
    <text wx:if="{{connectionMessage}}" class="readiness-card__warning">{{connectionMessage}} 已保留当前身份，可稍后重试。</text>
    <view class="readiness-card__divider"></view>
    <view class="readiness-card__row">
      <text>预约记录</text>
      <button class="readiness-card__link" bindtap="goAppointments">直接查看 ›</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:elif="{{authState !== 'loading'}}" class="readiness-card readiness-card--auth">
    <text class="readiness-card__auth-title">
      {{authState === 'expired' ? '演示会话已失效' : '先选择一位演示顾客'}}
    </text>
    <text class="readiness-card__body">
      {{authState === 'expired' ? '之前的页面位置已经保留，重新选择后可回到这里。' : '这是本地演示身份切换，不会调用微信真实登录。'}}
    </text>
    <button class="primary-button" bindtap="chooseCustomer">重新选择演示顾客</button>
  </view>

  <view class="service-promises">
    <text class="service-promises__title">安心预约洗护</text>
    <view class="service-promises__list">
      <view><text class="service-promises__mark">人</text><text>确定员工</text></view>
      <view><text class="service-promises__mark">价</text><text>价格透明</text></view>
      <view><text class="service-promises__mark">码</text><text>到店核销</text></view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="local-boundary">
    <text class="local-boundary__label">演示身份说明</text>
    <text>顾客身份由本地 API 临时签发，不是微信真实登录。会话失效时可重新选择，并回到之前的 tab。</text>
  </view>
</view>
